[{"source": "Guidelines - ASCO.pdf", "page": 1, "chunk_id": 1, "text": "URGENT: Urge Congress to Protect Cancer Research by Increasing Federal Funding for FY27! Home /Practice & Patients /Guidelines Guidelines ASCO Guidelines provide evidence-based recommendations and outline appropriate methods of treatment and care for clinicians. The guidelines address specific clinical situations (disease-oriented) or the use of approved medical products, procedures, or tests (modality-oriented). Multidisciplinary panels of experts, including patient advocates, develop ASCO Guidelines. Access ASCO Guidelines Browse and search full collection of ASCO Guidelines Browse or search all ASCO Guidelines by clinical area or keywords. Use the interactive, AI-powered ASCO Guidelines Assistant Search ASCO's clinical practice guidelines through a simple, intuitive, AI-powered chat, developed in partnership with Google Cloud. ASCO Guidelines Assistant is a benefit for ASCO members. About ASCO Contact Us Licensing ASCO Overview Press Center Careers at ASCO Mobile Apps Full Collection of ASCO Guidelines ASCO Guidelines Assistant Topic Priorities Open Comment of Draft Guidelines Get Involved Methodology Implementation Strategy Pocket Cards Become Member Search Sign In Abstracts Guidelines Journal Articles Posters Slides Videos Cookies Settings Accept This site uses cookies and similar technologies such as web beacons/pixels to collect information about how you interact with our website and to allow us to remember you, as described in our Privacy Policy. By default, cookies are set to “Allow all cookies,” but you can change your settings by visiting “Cookies Settings.” Use of our website represents your acceptance of our Terms of Use. 1/2", "embedding": [-0.062994085252285, 0.000481361843412742, -0.07887551188468933, 0.04626014083623886, -0.0005907711456529796, -0.0038143473211675882, 0.010878786444664001, 0.04079756140708923, -0.04772964119911194, -0.06550577282905579, -0.04526209086179733, -0